{title: Lantern Road}
{artist: Odile Fenn}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[G]Down the lanter[C]n road we go
[G]Past the mill a[D]nd through the snow
[G]Every window bu[C]rning gold
[D]Every story twi[G]ce as old
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Carry me, c[G]arry me home
[D]Down the lanter[G]n road
{end_of_chorus}
